  "boundary": "Native QCommandLinkButton/Z_CommandLinkButton keeps text/description/flat/checkable/checked/default/autoDefault/shortcut/click authority. Show description/show icon are adapter authoring visibility, not native bool setters. Fixed Pressed/Focus never mutate down/focus. No intrinsic exclusive selection or wizard navigation. Source Content height 52 clips Title22 + gap4 + Description36 by 10px; gallery preserves clipping, live presentation reserves enough height and records design issue. Original 16px arrows sit at top-left of source 24px icon slots; no SVG resizing/recoloring. Design approval, native layout parity and full normalized export remain open."
}
